      "filename": "Civil War Naval Museum, USS Hartford Captain's cabin.jpg",
      "title": "File:Civil War Naval Museum, USS Hartford Captain's cabin.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/Civil_War_Naval_Museum%2C_USS_Hartford_Captain%27s_cabin.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Civil_War_Naval_Museum,_USS_Hartford_Captain%27s_cabin.jpg",
      "width": 3431,
      "height": 2417,
